        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stan Dragoti, Ismet Toto\n- Places: Memaliaj, Vjosa River, Gjirokastër County, Vasjar\n- Events: 2015 Albanian local government reform\n\nFacts:\n- Memaliaj is a town in Gjirokastër County, Albania, on the banks of the Vjosa River.\n- Stan Dragoti came from Memaliaj.\n- After the 2015 Albanian local government reform, Vasjar became part of the municipality of Memaliaj.\n- Ismet Toto was originally from Vasjar.",
