        "original_id": "f3c82c52-4806-55ed-a354-c2a4e7a10612",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Progonat, Kurvelesh, Tepelenë, Gjirokastër County, Vjosa River, Drino, Albania, New York City\n- People: Ismet Toto, Stan Dragoti\n- Roles: bureaucrat, publicist, writer, revolutionary\n- Events: 2015 local government reform\n\nFacts:\n- Progonat is a village in the former Kurvelesh municipality in Gjirokastër County.\n- In the 1920s, Stan Dragoti's Albanian parents emigrated from the district of Tepelenë in southern Albania.\n- Ismet Toto was born in Progonat in 1908.\n- Ismet Toto was an Albanian bureaucrat, publicist, writer, and revolutionary.\n- Ismet Toto died in Gjirokastër in 1937.\n- In 2015, the local government reform made Progonat part of the municipality of Tepelenë.\n- Tepelenë is a town and a municipality in Gjirokastër County in southern Albania.\n- Tepelenë is located on the left bank of the Vjosa River, about three kilometres downstream from its confluence with the Drino.\n- Stan Dragoti was born in New York City to Albanian parents.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "75a92459-466b-51a7-adc5-d963fd4b9c2f",
        "text": "Page: Progonat. Sentence: Progonat is a village in the former Kurvelesh municipality, Gjirokastër County.\nPage: Progonat. Sentence: At the 2015 local government reform it became part of the municipality Tepelenë.\nPage: Tepelenë. Sentence: Tepelenë (definite Albanian form: \"Tepelena\" ) is a town and a municipality in Gjirokastër County, in the south of Albania.\nPage: Tepelenë. Sentence: The town is located on the left bank of the Vjosa River, about three kilometres downstream from its union with the Drino.\nPage: Ismet Toto. Sentence: Ismet Toto (Progonat, 1908 - Gjirokastër, 1937) was an Albanian bureaucrat, publicist, writer and revolutionary.\nPage: Stan Dragoti. Sentence: Dragoti was born in New York City to Albanian parents, both having emigrated in the 1920s from the district of Tepelenë, in Southern Albania.",
